ted olfactory placode.</article-title><source>Neuroscience</source><volume>5</volume><fpage>2175</fpage><lpage>2186</lpage><pub-id pub-id-type="pmid">7465050</pub-id></citation></ref><ref id="pone.0003816-Graziadei1"><label>19</label><citation citation-type="journal"><person-group person-group-type="author"><name><surname>Graziadei</surname><given-names>PPC</given-names></name><name><surname>Monti Graziadei</surname><given-names>GA</given-names></name></person-group><year>1992</year><article-title>The influence of the olfactory placode on the development of the telencephalon in Xenopus laevis.</article-title><source>Neuroscience</source><volume>46</volume><fpage>617</fpage><lpage>629</lpage><pub-id pub-id-type="pmid">1545913</pub-id></citation></ref><ref id="pone.0003816-CouperLeo1"><label>20</label><citation citation-type="journal"><person-group person-group-type="author"><name><surname>Couper Leo</surname><given-names>JM</given-names></name><name><surname>Devine</surname><given-names>AH</given-names></name><name><surname>Brunjes</surname><given-names>PC</given-names></name></person-group><year>2000</year><article-title>Focal denervation alters cellular phenotypes and survival in the developing rat olfactory bulb.</article-title><source>J Comp Neurol</source><volume>417</volume><fpage>325</fpage><lpage>336</lpage><pub-id pub-id-type="pmid">10683607</pub-id></citation></ref><ref id="pone.0003816-LopezMascaraque1"><label>21</label><citation citation-type="journal"><person-group person-group-type="author"><name><surname>Lopez-Mascaraque</surname><given-names>L</given-names></name><name><surname>Garcia</surname><given-names>C</given-names></name><name><surname>Blanchart</surname><given-names>A</given-names></name><name><surname>De Carlos</surname><given-names>JA</given-names></name></person-group><year>2005</year><article-title>Olfactory epithelium influences the orientation of mitral cell dendrites during development.</article-title><source>Dev Dyn</source><volume>232